		<p class="text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
			A daily logic puzzle for anime fans. Your mission is to find the shortest path from the starting anime to the target using verified industry relationships.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mb-16">
