			<h3 class="text-xl text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-3 relative z-10">Link Nodes</h3>
			<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed relative z-10">Click a node connected to your current position to move forward. Navigate through characters, voice actors, and studios to reach the target.</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Step 3 -->
		<div class="bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-rose-500/30 transition-colors">
			<div class="absolute -right-6 -top-6 text-9xl font-black text-white/[0.03] group-hover:text-rose-500/10 transition-colors pointer-events-none">3</div>
			<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-rose-400 mb-6">
