			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-3 relative z-10">Claim the Top Spot</h3>
			<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed relative z-10">The faster you connect the path, the higher you score. Aim for the Top 10 on the Daily Global Leaderboard and flex your name.</p>
		</div>
	</div>

