        <p class="text-center text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8">Not everything connects! To solve the puzzle, you must understand the verified relationships in our database.</p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
