        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-8 text-center bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/20 p-4 rounded-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <p class="text-rose-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Warning: Impossible Links</p>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">You <strong>cannot</strong> connect two characters directly, nor can you connect a Studio to a Voice Actor. You must always use the Anime node as a bridge! You can still try otherwise!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>